<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="d145aA" xml:lang="en">
   <title>Display Action</title>
   <prolog>
      <author>Rakesh Singh</author>
      <critdates>
         <created date="Jul 29, 2022"/>
      </critdates>
      <metadata>
         <prodinfo>
            <prodname>X-Author for Excel</prodname>
         </prodinfo>
      </metadata>
   </prolog>
   <conbody>
      <p>When data is retrieved from an environment using a <b>Query</b> or <b>Search &amp; Select</b> action, it remains in memory until a Display Action places that data into the workbook based on a <b>Display Map</b>.</p>
      <note type="note">
         <p>
            <b>Note</b>
         </p>
         <p>To create a Display Action, you must have an existing <xref href="../working_with_display_maps_98667693/98667693.dita"
                  format="dita">Display Map</xref>.</p>
      </note>
   </conbody>
</concept>
